Website template and adaptations

This website adapts Academic Project Page Template by Eliahu Horwitz:
https://github.com/eliahuhorwitz/Academic-project-page-template
The original template incorporates work from Nerfies:
https://nerfies.github.io/

The template and this site's template adaptations are licensed under Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).
License terms: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Changes include paper-specific layout and content, locally hosted Newsreader,
interactive rollout comparison, and accessible resource and citation controls.

Third-party components retain their own licenses: Bulma (MIT) and Newsreader
(SIL Open Font License; see dist/static/fonts/OFL.txt).

This notice does not assign a new license to the paper, research data, or
scientific media. Refer to their original sources and applicable permissions.
